If a clinician provides a supportive-contraceptive-counseling to a patient and the patient has a reproductive-goal then the clinician should intentionally apply a patient-centered-reproductive-justice-framework for the reproductive-goal and should use a shared-decision-making with the patient for the reproductive-goal.
If a clinician provides a supportive-contraceptive-care to a patient and the patient has a reproductive-goal then the clinician should intentionally apply a patient-centered-reproductive-justice-framework for the reproductive-goal and should use a shared-decision-making with the patient for the reproductive-goal.
